  "id": "paralanguage",
  "term": "paralanguage",
  "definition": "Paralanguage refers to nonverbal information carried in the voice, such as vocal emotional cues, rather than the words themselves. In this context, it means recognizing or using affective qualities of speech as part of communication.",
